[{"id":3390587294,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7KGEGe","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nSome feedback for further improvements, which we may want to tackle here:\r\n\r\n- The background in the initial view seems much darker than anything else in the editor:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1051\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a862ab80-f48c-4d2c-bbf6-2ddc6c59fef2\" />\r\n\r\n(When using a light theme, it's much brighter than anything else instead.)\r\n\r\nFor this particular view, I suggest using a standard background color when no snapshot has been taken yet. Look at the Animation bottom panel for an example:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1362\" height=\"280\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70c176a4-189b-4099-bfcc-c518622a0edf\" />\r\n\r\n- I suggest increasing line separation in the Summary view, as lines are quite close to each other right now (compared to the rest of the editor).\r\n\r\n- I suggest using bold instead of italic for texts in the Summary view, since we don't have an italic font in the editor and are therefore using *faux* italic (which doesn't look great). In contrast, we have an actual bold font shipped in the editor.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1051\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d46792fe-4613-438c-afa2-b273ee083a13\" />\r\n\r\n- It's possible for the Classes, Objects and RefCounted side panels to overflow if it's resized to its minimum allowed size:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"321\" height=\"232\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a0be765-9deb-4635-ac3f-3ced2d1f30df\" />\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111268#pullrequestreview-3390587294","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111268","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111268#pullrequestreview-3390587294"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111268"}},"submitted_at":"2025-10-28T20:02:27Z","commit_id":"dafc6c4cefc39ed068e19b8729ff5ec21940b04e"},{"id":3586722928,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7VyQxw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/pr